ga02(){return"H\u0131z Azaltma, s\xfcrd\xfck\xe7e <spd>H\u0131z\u0131</spd> bir y\xfczde kadar d\xfc\u015f\xfcr\xfcr. Tur \xe7ubu\u011fu daha yava\u015f dolar, Ovaling s\u0131ras\u0131n\u0131 daha ge\xe7 ve daha seyrek al\u0131r."},
