Ys(a){return"Z\u0131rh: yaln\u0131zca kritik vuru\u015flar hasar verir, gerisi seker. Ona kar\u015f\u0131 <crit>kritik \u015fans\u0131n</crit> "+a+" y\xfczde puan\u0131 d\xfc\u015f\xfckt\xfcr, kesin kritikler her zaman isabet eder."},
