ga_z(){return"S\xfcrd\xfck\xe7e hedefteki her iyile\u015ftirme, can \xe7alma ve yenilenme dahil, yetene\u011fin de\u011feri kadar k\xfc\xe7\xfcl\xfcr. Ar\u0131nd\u0131rma onu kald\u0131r\u0131r."},
