Uq(a){return"Turunun ba\u015f\u0131nda tak\u0131m ortalamas\u0131n\u0131n alt\u0131ndaki m\xfcttefiklerin <hp>can\u0131</hp> ortalamaya %"+a+" yakla\u015f\u0131r. \xdcst\xfcndekiler bunun yar\u0131s\u0131 kadar verir, kimse bu y\xfczden d\xfc\u015fmez."},
